<https://w3id.org/eudpp/P_DPP> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/P_DPP> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation> <https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15270342> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/P_DPP> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Riina Maigre"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/P_DPP> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Tarmo Robal"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/P_DPP> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Theodor Chirvasuta"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/P_DPP> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2025-01-29"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/P_DPP> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Hele-Mai Haav (up until version 1.7.1 incl.), further maintained by contributors."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/P_DPP> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The EU DPP core ontology proposed in CIRPASS-2 European project  is a shared formal specification of basic concepts and properties/relationships in the cross-sectorial DPP domain to facilitate knowledge sharing across sector-specific DPPs.\n\nThe proposed  EU DPP core ontology captures several modules from which the Product and DPP module plays a central role.\n\nDEPENDENCIES:  This module has dependencies to the following EU DPP Core Ontology (CO) modules: CON, ACTOR, SOC.  \n\nFor more information, see \nMaigre, R., Haav, H.-M., Robal, T., Wolf, M.-A., & Danash, F. (2025). Ontology Requirements Specification for an EU DPP Core Ontology Proposal (1.1). CIRPASS-2 Consortium. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15270342\n\n"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/P_DPP> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-09-22"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/P_DPP> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/P_DPP> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> "This ontology is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. \nIn case of dispute over Apache 2.0 applicability, or in case considering the ontology as a document, this ontology document is to be considered licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/P_DPP> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "The Product and DPP module of an EU regulatory compliant Digital Product Passport Core Ontology (EU DPP CO) proposed by the CIRPASS-2 European project."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/P_DPP> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> "dpp" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/P_DPP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Product and DPP module of an EU DPP core ontology proposed by the CIRPASS-2 European project."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/P_DPP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EU DPP CO P_DPP"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/P_DPP> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "2.0.7" .
