<https://w3id.org/eudpp#MaterialFootprint> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#MaterialFootprint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Material footprint\nrefers to the total amount of raw materials extracted to meet final consumption demands. (ESPR Art 2 (26))\n\nThis class description needs to be extended/specialised according to the corresponding delegated acts or/and industry standards."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#MaterialFootprint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Material footprint"@en .
