# https://w3id.org/eudpp#ProductDimension
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#ProductDimension> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#ProductDimension> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#QuantitativeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#ProductDimension> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "ESPR Annex I"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#ProductDimension> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj" .
